        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke sengilinikeza kuNkulunkulu laselizwini lomusa wakhe, elilamandla okulakha lokulabela ilifa phakathi kwabo bonke abamahlukaniselweyo. ",
          "type": "text",
