        {
          "text": "Kukho konke ngilitshengisile ukuthi kumele ukuba sisize ababuthakathaka ngokusebenza okunjalo, sikhumbule amazwi eNkosi uJesu ukuthi yena wathi: Kubusisekile ukupha kulokwamukela.",
